      "desc": "When a squadmate triggers <color=#FFFFFF>Aftershock</color>, Hoshimi Miyabi gains 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>Resolution</color>, stacking up to 3 times. After using <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Shimotsuki</color>, press Basic Attack <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to consume 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>Resolution</color> and trigger 1 instance of <color=#FFFFFF>Frost Blade Pursuit</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>Frost Blade Pursuit</color> is an <color=#FFFFFF>Aftershock</color> and can be retriggered by consuming <color=#FFFFFF>Resolution</color>.",
